OL,9,     Fand composing music with the help
OL,10,     Fof plants used in chemotherapy.
OL,11,G0350 Witness History
OL,12,     FIn 2000, a stadium concert in
OL,13,     FMexico sparked a lightbulb moment
OL,14,     Ffor composer Manuel Eduardo
OL,15,     FToscano. His insult-filled song,
OL,16,     FRata de dos patas, went on to
OL,17,     Fbecome a huge hit.
